{"id":3986,"name":"Vinland Saga Season 2","slug":"vinland_saga_season_2","synopsis":"A new millennium begins in the southern part of the Jutland peninsula in Denmark. After the death of his longtime enemy, Askeladd, Thorfinn lost his purpose in life. He was bought by the landowner Ketil as a \"slave\" and engaged in land reclamation work on his farm. \n\r\n\n\r\nThorfinn meets a young man there, Einar, who was also a slave like him. The encounter of Einar led Thorfinn to face the sins he had committed and began to find meaning in life. \n\r\n\n\r\nOn the other hand, Canute, who became the King of England, attempted to extend his territory for the establishment of \"the promised land.\" \n\r\n\n\r\n(Source: Official Website)","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2023,"createdAt":"2023-01-09 03:43:42","updatedAt":"2023-01-09 03:43:42","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":49387},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":44875},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":136430},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":16426},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":17425},{"site":"ANN","externalId":24508},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":81249833}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":10633,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/XwLVsclAb7GR6ZMaOfxCzVT3OT57v5DtWkgQkEZD.jpg"},{"id":10634,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/OlELFSWGRA8VM7q3I2B46ohRk77n78yGjKQFGtni.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":89,"name":"MAPPA","slug":"mappa"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":256,"name":"Vinland Saga","slug":"vinland_saga"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":12045,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":12037,"title":"River","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":14053,"version":1,"episodes":"1-12","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":16445,"basename":"VinlandSagaS2-OP1.webm","filename":"VinlandSagaS2-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/VinlandSagaS2-OP1.webm","mimetype